  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Thilne Market Gardening Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to establish a irrigation system and develop 35 hectares of landin addition to the 150 hectares that it already cultivates. The funds will also be used to rehabilitate the feeder canal and establish a revolving fund to purchase rice for processing.</narrative>
  </description>
